'''Gallade ex''' (Japanese: '''エルレイドex''' ''Erureido ex'') is a {{ct|Fighting}} Stage 2 {{TCGP|Pokémon ex}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Space-Time Smackdown}} expansion.

