==Trivia==
The special illustration rare card features artwork that appears to heavily reference a digital-only [[Gardevoir (Pokémon TCG: Online Illustration Exhibition)|Gardevoir]] card with artwork by [[Takumi Wada]], which was showcased during the limited-time Pokémon Trading Card Game: Online Illustration Exhibition between August and October 2022. Both cards feature {{p|Kirlia}}'s [[Evolution]]s depicted from a slightly raised angle, standing in shallow water reflecting moonlight, {{p|Gardevoir}} looking to the bottom-right and {{p|Gallade}} to the bottom-left.

===Origin===
*This card's shiny super rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Gallade}}.

